!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Cells were treated as indicated with reduced glucose and/or beta-hydroxybutyrate
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Cells were routinely maintained in DMEM with 10% FBS, 2 mM glutamine and 50 ng/ml gentamycin
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Total RNA was extracted using Qiagen’s RNeasy Mini Kit
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = TruSeq Stranded mRNA LT Sample Prep Kit/TruSeq Stranded mRNA Sample Preparation Guide, Part # 15031047 Rev. E
!Sample_data_processing = The Illumina sequencer generates raw images utilizing sequencing control software for system control and base calling through an integrated primary analysis software called RTA (Real Time Analysis). The BCL (base calls) binary is converted into FASTQ utilizing illumina package bcl2fastq.
!Sample_data_processing = Illumina fastq files were pseudoaligned using "kallisto" (v0.46.1) using their prebuilt indices constructed from Ensembl Homo_sapiens.GRCh38 databases  creating abundance files (attached as processed data files)
!Sample_data_processing = Samples were loaded into "R" (version 4.0) using tximport and analyzed using the DESeq2 (version 1.28.1) pipeline.
!Sample_data_processing = Differential gene expression was established after shrinking DESeq2 outputs according to the the protocol established by Stephens, M. (2016) False discovery rates: a new deal. Biostatistics, 18:2.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: Homo_sapiens.GRCh38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Matrix with FPKM of all sample, treatment conditions and genes
